<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollickhofers</unclear></persName> seligen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßne</unclear> wittib, sin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
